            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "iRobot Co-Founder Calls Silence on China Sale \"Bizarre\"",
            "description": "Helen Greiner, co-founder of iRobot, says she is \"heartbroken\" over the company's bankruptcy and the transfer of its assets to a Chinese supplier. In an interview on Bloomberg's Insight with Haslinda Amin, she told Paul Allen it's \"bizarre\" that there is no outcry over U.S. know-how moving to China. Greiner also warned that low-cost manufacturing will remain a challenge for the U.S., even with tariffs, due to a persistent shortage of skilled labor.",
